BT
62.84 427.04 TD
(1.2 Budget Presentation Documents) Tj
0.36 260.24 TD
/F1 11.00 Tf
(It gives me great pleasure to present the 2012 Estimates of St. Christopher and Nevis in the) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(activity based and performance budgeting format that is intended to make the budget process) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(more transparent and improve Government's accountability to the citizens of the Federation with) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(respect to the use of public funds.) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(The 2012 Estimates provides details on Government Programs including quantitative indicators) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(that will be used to measure the extent to which Ministries have achieved their goals for the fiscal) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(year. It would also facilitate discussions on the Estimates by focusing primarily on performance) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(results rather than on just budget dollars.) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(It is my expectation that the packaging of the budget information would bring greater clarity and) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(understanding of the budget to readers and would assist the public in better assessing) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Government's performance.   The budget documents will also be used by Government) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(Departments as a tool to monitor and improve the activities they perform as well as the efficiency) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(of the services they execute and deliver to the people of the Federation  ) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(  ) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Rt. Hon. Dr Denzil L. Douglas) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(Minister of Finance) Tj
0.00 -69.36 TD
(The Estimates of Revenue and Expenditure for the Federal Government's operations for the) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(fiscal year ending 31 December 2012 are presented in this document.  It provides details of) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Government's expenditure intentions and revenue projections, reflecting the presentation of the) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(state budget to the Parliament and the Public.  ) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(This activity based and performance budget provides information through two volumes:) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Х Volume 1 Ц Government Expenditure and Revenue Plan ) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Х Volume 2 Ц Ministry Reports on Plans and Priorities) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Volume 1 consists of a broad presentation of the Government Expenditure Plan and aims at) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(providing a global and strategic view to the reader of where most of the Government's resources) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(are allocated.  It highlights total spending by Ministry, by Expenditure Type \(i.e. Recurrent,) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Transfer and Capital\) and by Expenditure Category \(i.e. Personal Emoluments and Wages,) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(Goods and Services, Interest, etc.\). ) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(It also covers the Government Consolidated Revenue which provides an overview of the revenue) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(projections for the Government of St. Christopher and Nevis.  It summarizes Total Government) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Revenue Ц Recurrent and Capital Revenue by Ministry \(portfolio\) as well as Budgetary Grants for) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(the fiscal year.  It compares the projected revenue at the Ministry and Department level for the) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(fiscal year and the previous year's estimates, to allow for year-over-year comparisons. It shows) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(over time the share of Government Revenue derived from recurrent proceeds, loans and) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(development aid \(grants\).) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(Volume 2 is a detailed report on plans and priorities for each Ministry, prepared to assist) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Members of Parliament in their review of the expenditure estimates.  A separate chapter of) Tj
