BT
62.84 624.96 TD
/F0 11.00 Tf
(1.3  Definition and Structure of the Government Expenditure Plan) Tj
0.9200 g
ET
62.84 358.12 472.64 16.80 re f*
0 g
BT
62.84 364.40 TD
(1.4 Presentation by Portfolio, Ministry and Autonomous Departments) Tj
0.36 393.32 TD
/F1 11.00 Tf
(Volume 2 is prepared for each portfolio, so that there are seventeen \(17\) chapters.  Specifically,) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(each chapter of Volume 2 includes an overview of the Ministry Ц Minister's message, Mission) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(Statement, summary of the portfolio planning for the voted year and an update on the major) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(capital projects within the portfolio.  It provides an active summary sheet for each program.  ) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(The framework of these two volumes offers the advantages of a modular approach to) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(government budget presentation.  A global perspective can be derived from Volume 1) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(\(Expenditure and Revenue\) and more detailed expenditure information at the Ministry level can be) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(obtained from a set of concise documents in Volume 2.) Tj
0.00 -69.36 TD
(The Government Expenditure plan for 2012 is aimed at prioritizing expenditure to critical) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(programs in order to produce a Current Account surplus.  Capital Revenue from the sale of) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(lands, loan funds and grant funds will contribute to the development of Capital Projects that will) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(spur economic growth in the Federation.) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(The Government has projected Total Expenditure of $637M in 2012 which includes projected) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(expenditure of $177M for Debt Principal Repayments. Therefore the projected Total Expenditure) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(excluding Debt Principal Repayments is $460M. Of this amount, $401M will be on Recurrent) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Programs, $58M will be on Capital Programs and $1M for Net Lending. Of the amount for) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Recurrent Programs, $168M will cover Personal Emoluments, Wages and Allowances, $70M will) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(cover Goods and Services, $98M will cover Debt Interest Payments and $65M will cover) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Transfers and Subsidies.  ) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(The Government has projected Total Revenue of $457M in 2012 of which $401M will be collected) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(from Recurrent Revenue, $5M from Sale of Lands and Property, $23M from Capital Grants and) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
($28M from Budgetary Grants.) Tj
0.00 -69.36 TD
(There are seventeen \(17\) portfolios in fourteen \(14\) Ministries and three \(3\) autonomous) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Departments in the government.  ) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(The Autonomous Departments are:) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(The Governor General which covers the portfolio of representing Her Majesty's role.) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Parliament which covers providing legislative support and governance.) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Audit Office which reports to Parliament on the government accounts and operations.) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(The Ministries and their respective portfolios are:) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
(Ministry of Justice and Legal Affairs covering all matters of the delivery of  justice, the Attorney) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(General's Office and other legal affairs) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(The Office of the Prime Minister covering the functions of the Prime Minister, human resources,) Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(promoting investments, police services and military defence.) Tj
0.00 -12.72 TD
() Tj
0.00 -12.76 TD
(Ministry of Homeland Security and Labour covering providing fire services, prison services,) Tj
